node_modules
# `dist/` is intentionally TRACKED so consumers installing trainer-sim via
# git-ref (e.g. VeloWorld/veloworld-ride) receive prebuilt artifacts
# directly. The `prepare` lifecycle hook was removed in Phase 5, so
# consumers do NOT rebuild on install — the committed `dist/` IS the
# source of truth. The `prepublishOnly` script + `dist-matches-src`
# guard in `publish.test.ts` (Phase 5 / WR-04) enforce that the tracked
# `dist/` is rebuilt from the current `src/` before publish/test.
coverage
